# mla / Meetless workspace binding and generated rule mirror. Both are created by
# `mla activate` and regenerated from its backend, so they are derived state, not
# source. Keeping them out avoids tying a published repo to a third-party service
# and stops a `git add -A` from committing machine-generated paraphrases of this
# README as if they were project docs.
.meetless.json
.meetless/
